%SIXMD 1
# @?CONFIGCTL - INSPECT CURRENT SYSTEM CONFIGURATION

## DESCRIPTION

CONFIGCTL PRINTS THE CURRENT SYSTEM, FSTAB, AND INITTAB POLICY FILES.  THE
DAIMOSV1 SYNTHETIC LIVE-CONFIG GENERATION AND COMMIT/ROLLBACK ABI WAS REMOVED;
CURRENT DAIMOS KEEPS ADMINISTRATIVE POLICY IN ORDINARY FILES UNDER /CONFIG AND
INIT APPLIES THAT POLICY.

MUTATING DAIMOSV1 CONFIGCTL SUBCOMMANDS ARE THEREFORE NOT ACCEPTED.  EDIT THE
AUTHORITATIVE /CONFIG FILES WITH NORMAL FILE OPERATIONS INSTEAD.

## @?FILES

### @?/CONFIG/SYSTEM
SYSTEM STORAGE POLICY.

### @?/CONFIG/FSTAB
FILESYSTEM MOUNT POLICY.

### @?/CONFIG/INITTAB
SERVICE RESPAWN POLICY.

## @?EXIT STATUS

### @?0 - CONFIGURATION WAS PRINTED
### @?1 - A CONFIGURATION FILE COULD NOT BE READ
### @?2 - RETIRED LIVE-STAGING SUBCOMMAND WAS REQUESTED

## @?SEE ALSO

### @?INIT
### @?MOUNTS
